WEBVTT

00:00:08.626 --> 00:00:11.045
[ALL GRUNTING]

00:00:19.261 --> 00:00:22.390
♪ London Bridge is falling down Falling down, falling down ♪

00:00:22.390 --> 00:00:24.016
[MUFFLED] ♪ London Bridge is... ♪

00:00:24.016 --> 00:00:26.227
[♪♪♪]

00:00:28.688 --> 00:00:30.648
[CAT MEOWING] [DOG BARKS]

00:00:30.648 --> 00:00:31.940
One of these?

00:00:31.940 --> 00:00:33.067
[SNIFFS]

00:00:33.067 --> 00:00:34.443
Oh, yeah. Lovely, isn't it?

00:00:34.443 --> 00:00:35.861
[SNIFFS, SIGHS, OINKS]

00:00:35.861 --> 00:00:37.363
SARA: Two pounds, please.

00:00:37.363 --> 00:00:39.114
Thanks.

00:00:39.114 --> 00:00:41.534
[♪♪♪]

00:00:43.744 --> 00:00:46.205
Let's kick this off, son. For your dad.

00:00:46.205 --> 00:00:47.456
[GRUNTS]

00:00:50.209 --> 00:00:53.087
VENDOR: Have a lovely day. CUSTOMER: Bye.

00:00:53.087 --> 00:00:54.505
[GROANS]

00:00:58.467 --> 00:00:59.968
[BOTH GRUNTING]

00:01:06.850 --> 00:01:08.310
[YELPS]

00:01:09.311 --> 00:01:12.523
[SNEEZES, GRUNTS] [SCREAMS]

00:01:12.523 --> 00:01:13.608
[GROANS]

00:01:15.610 --> 00:01:17.861
[COTTON-TAIL GASPING]

00:01:17.861 --> 00:01:20.531
Magic beans.

00:01:20.531 --> 00:01:23.451
[LAUGHING HYSTERICALLY]

00:01:23.451 --> 00:01:24.452
[YELLS]

00:01:24.452 --> 00:01:25.994
I'm alive!

00:01:25.994 --> 00:01:27.580
[SNORING]

00:01:29.248 --> 00:01:32.126
[PIGLING GRUNTING] [PEOPLE YELLING]

00:01:33.794 --> 00:01:35.963
[SNORTS, GRUNTS]

00:01:35.963 --> 00:01:37.005
[YELLS]

00:01:38.340 --> 00:01:40.342
Stop, he's not a farmer.

00:01:40.342 --> 00:01:42.386
Really? But he's dressed like one.

00:01:42.386 --> 00:01:46.181
It's a style. Cultural appropriation.

00:01:46.181 --> 00:01:47.891
Makes me sick.

00:01:47.891 --> 00:01:49.101
Oh, there's a farmer.

00:01:49.101 --> 00:01:50.227
[PETER GRUNTS] [GROANS]

00:01:50.227 --> 00:01:52.563
[♪♪♪]

00:01:58.193 --> 00:01:59.612
[LATCH CLICKS]

00:02:01.947 --> 00:02:04.700
VENDOR: How are you, sir?

00:02:04.700 --> 00:02:07.077
Here you go. Super with fennel. Enjoy it.

00:02:10.539 --> 00:02:12.874
Here you are. Thanks very much.

00:02:16.671 --> 00:02:19.089
What did Peter say?

00:02:22.760 --> 00:02:25.304
The rabbit comes out of the hole,

00:02:25.304 --> 00:02:27.181
goes round the tree

00:02:27.181 --> 00:02:29.266
and back down the hole.

00:02:29.266 --> 00:02:30.810
Ah.

00:02:39.318 --> 00:02:41.487
[YELLS]

00:02:41.487 --> 00:02:43.864
[DISTORTED] William!

00:02:46.450 --> 00:02:48.703
[CREAKING]

00:03:06.011 --> 00:03:08.639
[SCREAMS]

00:03:08.639 --> 00:03:10.432
[PANTING]

00:03:11.517 --> 00:03:12.518
Peter?

00:03:12.518 --> 00:03:13.977
Hyah! Oh, oh!

00:03:13.977 --> 00:03:16.188
[♪♪♪]

00:03:19.066 --> 00:03:20.735
[PEOPLE CLAMORING]

00:03:22.778 --> 00:03:25.364
Come on.

00:03:25.364 --> 00:03:26.407
[SIGHS]

00:03:26.407 --> 00:03:27.533
[PANTING]

00:03:29.535 --> 00:03:31.704
Head to the petting zoo. We can blend in

00:03:31.704 --> 00:03:34.456
with those weird animals that don't talk.

00:03:45.300 --> 00:03:46.886
[BOTH PANTING]

00:03:47.720 --> 00:03:49.971
Let's go. ALL: Huh?

00:03:49.971 --> 00:03:51.849
We'll take it from here.

00:03:51.849 --> 00:03:53.475
TOM: In you hop.

00:03:57.688 --> 00:03:59.022
[GRUNTS]

00:03:59.022 --> 00:04:00.941
[GROANS]

00:04:00.941 --> 00:04:02.109
[CAR HORN HONKING]

00:04:02.109 --> 00:04:04.361
All right, closing time. Sure.

00:04:04.361 --> 00:04:07.239
Oy, what's all this, then? Where is everyone?

00:04:07.239 --> 00:04:09.324
[♪♪♪]

00:04:09.324 --> 00:04:10.910
[GROANS]

00:04:12.620 --> 00:04:14.288
Wait. Oh!

00:04:14.288 --> 00:04:16.039
[GRUNTING]

00:04:23.756 --> 00:04:25.800
PETER: No! Hey, Benjamin?

00:04:27.802 --> 00:04:29.553
Wha--? What's going on?

00:04:29.553 --> 00:04:31.806
Let them go! What are they doing?

00:04:31.806 --> 00:04:33.724
Don't get yourself caught too, son.

00:04:33.724 --> 00:04:37.185
But if you did, just be a bigger share for us, anyway, innit?

00:04:40.981 --> 00:04:43.525
Peter! Wait, wait! Peter!

00:04:43.525 --> 00:04:44.944
[GRUNTS]

00:04:44.944 --> 00:04:46.946
MAN: Come on, let's go.

00:04:46.946 --> 00:04:49.448
No, no, stop. No, no, no, wait. Stop, stop!

00:04:49.448 --> 00:04:51.283
Wait!

00:04:57.122 --> 00:04:58.290
You set us up.

00:04:58.290 --> 00:05:00.334
We didn't not set you up,

00:05:00.334 --> 00:05:01.877
if you catch my smell.

00:05:01.877 --> 00:05:03.295
Good one, sis.

00:05:03.295 --> 00:05:05.881
You really thought we were gonna share all this

00:05:05.881 --> 00:05:07.257
with those yokels?

00:05:07.257 --> 00:05:08.759
We just needed bodies.

00:05:08.759 --> 00:05:11.011
Sweet, dumb, bumpkin bodies

00:05:11.011 --> 00:05:13.722
that will follow you anywhere.

00:05:13.722 --> 00:05:15.474
Is this still part of the plan?

00:05:15.474 --> 00:05:16.892
Did Peter do this?

00:05:16.892 --> 00:05:18.644
He's not here, is he?

00:05:18.644 --> 00:05:21.229
Maybe he really is a bad seed.

00:05:21.229 --> 00:05:23.023
[GOAT BLEATS]

00:05:23.023 --> 00:05:24.358
Dad was your best friend.

00:05:24.358 --> 00:05:26.694
And my best friend is the Sugar Plum Fairy.

00:05:26.694 --> 00:05:29.112
[ALL LAUGHING]

00:05:29.112 --> 00:05:31.365
I'm kidding. She's very hard to get to know.

00:05:31.365 --> 00:05:34.117
Closed off. She's Russian.

00:05:34.117 --> 00:05:35.661
You never knew my dad.

00:05:35.661 --> 00:05:39.540
Wouldn't be caught dead in some country garden.

00:05:39.540 --> 00:05:41.792
Like he was.

00:05:41.792 --> 00:05:43.126
Why did you do this?

00:05:43.126 --> 00:05:45.253
No one wanted to adopt me anymore.

00:05:45.253 --> 00:05:48.089
I was too old. I was being replaced.

00:05:48.089 --> 00:05:50.843
Every kid in town wanted a young rabbit

00:05:50.843 --> 00:05:53.387
like the one in that book.

00:05:53.387 --> 00:05:56.056
So I tracked you down.

00:05:56.056 --> 00:05:57.975
I was just gonna use you as bait

00:05:57.975 --> 00:05:59.852
for a few fake-and-takes.

00:05:59.852 --> 00:06:01.562
But then I saw how good you were

00:06:01.562 --> 00:06:03.647
and I figured we could do something

00:06:03.647 --> 00:06:05.733
a lot bigger together.

00:06:05.733 --> 00:06:06.734
You lied to me.

00:06:06.734 --> 00:06:08.360
It's not hard to lie to someone

00:06:08.360 --> 00:06:10.320
who wants to believe.

00:06:10.320 --> 00:06:12.322
But one thing is dead true.

00:06:12.322 --> 00:06:14.282
We are a great team.

00:06:14.282 --> 00:06:16.994
That's why you're in this truck with us

00:06:16.994 --> 00:06:19.538
instead of in a cage with them.

00:06:19.538 --> 00:06:21.707
This is where you belong, Peter.

00:06:21.707 --> 00:06:24.001
We're your family now.

00:06:24.001 --> 00:06:25.085
No.

00:06:25.085 --> 00:06:26.795
My family's in trouble

00:06:26.795 --> 00:06:28.797
and it's all my fault.

00:06:29.798 --> 00:06:31.132
[GRUNTS, YELLS]

00:06:31.132 --> 00:06:33.761
[♪♪♪]

00:06:37.514 --> 00:06:39.224
[PANTING]

